{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838310/extras/3cf4ed4980a39b2b5ec3e900010328b0.avif?t=1759862021\" width=1600 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round in Deckout plays differently. Choose the required number of cards face-down, then reveal hands in turn. Scoring happens on the spot with clear visual feedback, while a randomly chosen round rule twists the math\u2014sometimes boosting pairs or straights, other times flipping the logic entirely. When the dust settles, the lowest performer gets hammered and loses a heart. With only three hearts, tension builds fast; the last player standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838310/extras/a5c7c3d2d058b9178b8a96908c3e10ee.avif?t=1759862021\" width=501 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with friends or add smart bots that act like real players and react to what happens on the table. The whole experience is built to read at a glance so the fun never slows down.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u20134 players: play with friends or fill seats with bots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret picks, sequential reveals: a quick, dramatic rhythm every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random round rules: fresh strategies each match, no two sessions alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer &amp; hearts: three hearts only\u2014fall behind and you\u2019ll feel it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snappy matches: designed for 5\u201310 minute bursts of competitive chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive characters and punchy audio for instant, readable feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to track your highlights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838310?t=1759862021","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838310/c5c57758bb45393de3d3d8d8a5c244021cad3f0f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759862021","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838310/0f1cf543bd03a917225788cc154f154d755c8bbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759862021","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838310/0f1cf543bd03a917225788cc154f154d755c8bbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759862021","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3971070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838310/extras/3cf4ed4980a39b2b5ec3e900010328b0.avif?t=1759862021\" width=1600 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round in Deckout plays differently. Choose the required number of cards face-down, then reveal hands in turn. Scoring happens on the spot with clear visual feedback, while a randomly chosen round rule twists the math\u2014sometimes boosting pairs or straights, other times flipping the logic entirely. When the dust settles, the lowest performer gets hammered and loses a heart. With only three hearts, tension builds fast; the last player standing wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838310/extras/a5c7c3d2d058b9178b8a96908c3e10ee.avif?t=1759862021\" width=501 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with friends or add smart bots that act like real players and react to what happens on the table. The whole experience is built to read at a glance so the fun never slows down.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\u20134 players: play with friends or fill seats with bots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret picks, sequential reveals: a quick, dramatic rhythm every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random round rules: fresh strategies each match, no two sessions alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hammer &amp; hearts: three hearts only\u2014fall behind and you\u2019ll feel it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snappy matches: designed for 5\u201310 minute bursts of competitive chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive characters and punchy audio for instant, readable feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements to track your highlights.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ahmed jalil"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838310/b3336c0081dfcb2df957404ddf9925ea992b4697/header.jpg?t=1759862021","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Ahmed Jalil. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nDeckout is a trademark of Ahmed Jalil.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838310/2029765197/3feb55a7480fff58ac4a166a83e436c01decf3de/1759340193/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759340847","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3838310/2029765197/3feb55a7480fff58ac4a166a83e436c01decf3de/1759340193/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759340847","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.